# Pillar of Origins names Goblin; its mana is "only to cast a creature spell of the chosen type" (CR 106.6, 205.3m).
# Woodland Changeling is every creature type, in the hand and on the stack (changeling, CR 702.73a), so it is a Goblin
# creature spell: it is offered with the Pillar's {G} and Mox Jet's {B} and cast with them. Llanowar Elves, an Elf only,
# can't be cast with the Pillar's {G}.

